{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHorror Game\u201d \u00d7 \u201cDating Sim\u2026?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid being spotted by the clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the Seven Mysteries,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >raise your affection level,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and aim for the GOOD END!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror adventure set in a school at midnight. Explore freely in 3D, uncovering clues to the Seven Mysteries hidden within. Your choices lead to different endings. In the silence of the halls, face eerie phenomena\u2014can you survive until dawn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that if you uncover all seven mysteries, your wish will be granted...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing in the rumor, a lone girl sets off on her adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with the mysterious ghost \u201cHanako,\u201d who suddenly appears, she wanders the school at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of her harrowing journey, what truth will she discover...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2020 Streaming Guidelines \u2020</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos, recorded videos, and live streaming are permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization related to these activities is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior permission or contact is required.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5c11\u5973\u306e\u7b56\u7565","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947690/1eb52e57842c5d1678b453bcc6ca9c55d3a25342.jpg"},{"name":"\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u307e\u3060\u7d42\u308f\u3063\u3066\u3044\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947690/3a8b359fdeb5acec091f9c49e55567ea9ab00743.jpg"},{"name":"\u9858\u3044\u306e\u6210